  "notes": [
    "Effective capacitance at IN and OUT must exceed 0.47 uF after DC bias, tolerance and temperature (datasheet p. 3 and section 7.1.1). The support circuit starts with 1 uF, 10 V X5R/X7R in 0603; verify the selected capacitor's derating curve. Package size alone does not guarantee effective capacitance.",
    "The DBV package is about 231 °C/W on a JEDEC board: at 500 mA keep VIN close to 3.6 V or give GND copper."
